{"title":"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/d/6ad08b5dfbcc64aa34fb5443552bec510758d8e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^8\\cdot5^2=a^b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"19\" /> where both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive integers, find the smallest possible value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f26336f4ef97f584927d264f40a5237efaeb4601.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 25 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 34 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 351 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 407 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/1/f61c9134d3e931ccdcf64326ab0ba2cd581c8b8a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3^8\\cdot5^2 = (3^4)^2\\cdot5^2 = (3^4\\cdot5)^2 = 405^2\\]\" width=\"279\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/c/3dc228bd77701d8bed244703342dd3cee93bd56c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is not a perfect power, so the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c7fc73e7eebc76b0ca7b5afb12a96eb473e2538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$405+2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 407}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"157\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The greatest common factor of the exponents of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387be85c97b527ddd652f307ed502f32ad0c79c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^8$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/9/369aa2b96d08192baf66da44577be596a58d6778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. If we take the square root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387be85c97b527ddd652f307ed502f32ad0c79c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^8$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/9/369aa2b96d08192baf66da44577be596a58d6778.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and multiply them to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84c457d8d5c2c21a2ba528b7b0e8e28f3badcd3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=405$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/3/793971d64480bb3b8eb13f7e541ec0741be6652c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = 405+2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 407}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"222\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xhhmWhaOK2E\">https://youtu.be/xhhmWhaOK2E</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B\">2003 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" clas